OL,14,     FPhil Spencer meet the Lindleys,
OL,15,     Fwho are torn over their bungalow
OL,16,     Fin Ashtead, Surrey. Pippa dreams
OL,17,     Fof moving to Kent but Bill's
OL,18,     Fhaving none of it.
